/**
 * NOAA's daily geomagnetic data, kept here for the days the GFZ archive does not answer.
 *
 * Each line is NOAA SWPC's published day as written in its quarterly file: the date, the Fredericksburg and
 * College indices, then the estimated planetary A and the eight three-hour planetary Kp values. Only the day lines
 * are kept. The files are final once the quarter ends, so they never need refreshing.
 *
 * 2024 Q2 holds the May 2024 storm, the day this service's replay is built around. 2025 Q4 to 2026 Q3, with
 * NOAA's live thirty days, make a whole year. Fetched from ftp://ftp.swpc.noaa.gov/pub/indices/old_indices/ on
 * 22 October 2026, when every GFZ address had stopped answering. Read by parseNoaaDays in history.ts.
 */
